 "shots": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 6.0,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "Yo, I'm tired of the internet putting out some weak wool chocolate chip cookie recipes, so I decided to make my own."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 6.0,
   "e": 12.63,
   "dur": 6.63,
   "text": "Listen, I know you got big strong hands, but today we're gonna go with the mixer. To make a good cookie is to cream the butter in the sugar correctly."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 12.63,
   "e": 21.4,
   "dur": 8.77,
   "text": "We're gonna put in some butter and brown sugar. And some white sugar. Beat this on medium high speed and we're going to cream this for about 3 to 4 minutes until it's nice and fluffy."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 21.4,
   "e": 34.53,
   "dur": 13.13,
   "text": "Now beat in each egg well after each addition. Now before I mix my flour into the butter, I'm going to put in my salt, my cornstarch, and then lastly my baking soda. And with the littlest whiskey have we're just going to mix that all together just to get things cohesive."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 34.53,
   "e": 36.33,
   "dur": 1.8,
   "text": "I just learn what cohesive means to"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 36.33,
   "e": 37.23,
   "dur": 0.9,
   "text": "put the whole thing in there."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 37.23,
   "e": 40.3,
   "dur": 3.07,
   "text": "Now we only want to mix it until it's just combined. Now we're gonna"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 40.3,
   "e": 45.43,
   "dur": 5.13,
   "text": "fold in hecka chocolate chips and hecka chopped pecans. Do we gotta be pecans?"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 45.43,
   "e": 52.6,
   "dur": 7.17,
   "text": "No, but as long as you got some nut in there, it should be good. Look, I told you these bad boys are big, okay? So we're gonna go ahead and weigh seven to eight ounces"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 52.6,
   "e": 57.13,
   "dur": 4.53,
   "text": "per ball. These are going in the oven at 375, 12 to 13"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 57.13,
   "e": 63.83,
   "dur": 6.7,
   "text": "minutes. And y'all know it would be disrespectful of me if I didn't dip it in some mick. Mmm."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 63.83,
   "e": 65.9,
   "dur": 2.07,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 65.9,
   "e": 70.4,
   "dur": 4.5,
   "text": "Save this recipe so you have a good one forever. Mmm."
  }
 ],
